                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Yes this game is an asset flip, so what should I do to play? Pay $29.50 on https://www.assetstore.unity3d.com/en/#!/content/55700 or pay $1,79 for this? \nTell me where is the problem?\n\nThe principle you're right, that's why I would like to make refund but not only; the game is incomplete that was a reason of the cheap price, have a more potential to be the best fly simulator, but without a multiplayer, statistics, story line, more music, more achievements, more mission and other, it's just a copy of incomplete idea from the original developer (It's not stolen and reverted). So if you are confused as me meanwhile stay away and wait for news updating, but If you want to play a casual race fly game with gorgeous world that make you in a trip, take it!",
